msgid ""
"Dropbox needs an app registered to you:\n"
"1. At dropbox.com/developers/apps, press Create app.\n"
"2. Choose Scoped access, then App folder or Full Dropbox.\n"
"3. Give it a name no one else has used and press Create app.\n"
"4. On Permissions, tick account_info.read, files.content.write and "
"sharing.write, then press Submit.\n"
"5. On Settings, under OAuth 2, add the redirect URI {uri} and press Add.\n"
"6. Copy the App key into the field above.\n"
"Development status is enough. Leave the field empty to use this build's own "
"key, if it has one."
msgstr ""
"El Dropbox necessita una aplicació registrada per tu:\n"
"1. A dropbox.com/developers/apps, prem Create app.\n"
"2. Tria Scoped access, i després App folder o Full Dropbox.\n"
"3. Dona-li un nom que ningú més no hagi fet servir i prem Create app.\n"
"4. A Permissions, marca account_info.read, files.content.write i "
"sharing.write, i després prem Submit.\n"
"5. A Settings, sota OAuth 2, afegeix l'URI de redirecció {uri} i prem Add.\n"
"6. Copia l'App key al camp de dalt.\n"
"L'estat Development és suficient. Deixa el camp buit per utilitzar la clau "
"pròpia d'aquesta versió, si en té una."

